==Description==
'''Random Tower Positions''' is a modifier which currently appears nowhere in the game. It was only briefly active on the 1st of October 2025 and during the [[Halloween 2025 Live Events]].

==Effects==
When active, all towers placed on the map will begin changing positions every wave.

